  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Three identical charged balls each of charge <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>C</mi></math> are suspended from a common point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math> by silk threads of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> each (as shown in figure). They form an equilateral triangle of side <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>.</p><p>The ratio of net force on a charged ball to the force between any two charged balls will be</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/69ba51c5-2f6a-4539-a554-cfb5cc748e71-image.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 212px;\" /></p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "JtCng",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn></math>",
      "isCorrect": true,
