  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/c8be4247-8bbb-4c40-a00b-ece9bb5d5cad-image.png\" style=\"width: 170px; height: 154px;\" /></p><p>We have force between any two charge<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><msub><mi>&#949;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msup><mi>l</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>F</mi></math></p><p>Resultant electrostatics force&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>R</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msubsup><mi>F</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>cos</mi><mn>60</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></math></p><p>So, the ratio of net force on a charged ball to the force between any charged balls&nbsp;is&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>R</mi></msub><mi>F</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math></p>",
